{"id":"n62599-1-7","stage":1,"title":"일부 · 一部分","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62599-1-7-1","ko":"사무실에서 불이 나 사무실 물건의 일부가 타 버렸어.","zh":"办公室失火，一部分东西烧掉了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사무실에서","meaning":"办公室","explanation":"사무실：办公室；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"사무실","audio":"/audio/e94254252a6c513183a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61202","senseId":"1","lemma":"사무실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사무실에서","audio":"/audio/d30cebc3b299e51f6f8f.mp3"}},{"text":"불이","meaning":"火灾","explanation":"불：火灾；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"불","audio":"/audio/05e6efdf147502fc3ac3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61154","senseId":"3","lemma":"불","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"불이","audio":"/audio/9312b03715e82a6ac161.mp3"}},{"text":"나","meaning":"发生","explanation":"나다：发生；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"7","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}},{"text":"사무실","meaning":"办公室","explanation":"사무실：办公室。","readings":[{"term":"사무실","audio":"/audio/e94254252a6c513183a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61202","senseId":"1","lemma":"사무실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사무실","audio":"/audio/e94254252a6c513183a9.mp3"}},{"text":"물건의","meaning":"东西，物品，物件","explanation":"물건：东西，物品，物件；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"물건","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66247","senseId":"1","lemma":"물건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물건의","audio":"/audio/4574391abdeccb124dbe.mp3"}},{"text":"일부가","meaning":"一部分","explanation":"일부：一部分；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일부","audio":"/audio/32555f5ba712b1fdaf74.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62599","senseId":"1","lemma":"일부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일부가","audio":"/audio/9657e6b05198fd522ee0.mp3"}},{"text":"타","meaning":"烧，燃，燃烧，着火","explanation":"타다：烧，燃，燃烧，着火；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91122","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"타","audio":"/audio/7e40449e6f383f05b54a.mp3"}},{"text":"버렸어.","meaning":"做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）","explanation":"버리다：做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"버리다","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62601","senseId":"1","lemma":"버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버렸어","audio":"/audio/fe1d7a5ead4341d8e790.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e94254252a6c5131","term":"사무실","zh":"办公室","audio":"/audio/e94254252a6c513183a9.mp3","entryId":"61202","definition":"职场中主要用于各自处理文件等业务的房间。","pronunciation":["사ː무실"]},{"id":"05e6efdf147502fc","term":"불","zh":"火灾","audio":"/audio/05e6efdf147502fc3ac3.mp3","entryId":"61154","definition":"房子或东西被烧的灾祸或灾难。","pronunciation":["불"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发生","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现某种现象或事件。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"df279371093362d8","term":"물건","zh":"东西，物品，物件","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3","entryId":"66247","definition":"具有一定形状的某种物质。","pronunciation":["물건"]},{"id":"32555f5ba712b1fd","term":"일부","zh":"一部分","audio":"/audio/32555f5ba712b1fdaf74.mp3","entryId":"62599","definition":"一部分；或指全部中的一些。","pronunciation":["일부"]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"烧，燃，燃烧，着火","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"91122","definition":"因火苗或高温而燃气火焰或火势蔓延。","pronunciation":["타다"]},{"id":"51654377be6bf0a0","term":"버리다","zh":"做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3","entryId":"62601","definition":"做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）","pronunciation":["버리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3b4c4b97db9736cf9557.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62599-1-7-2","ko":"그래도 사무실 전체가 안 탔으니 정말 다행이다.","zh":"幸好没有把整个办公室都烧掉。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래도","meaning":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","explanation":"그래도：“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"그래도","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36264","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래도","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3"}},{"text":"사무실","meaning":"办公室","explanation":"사무실：办公室。","readings":[{"term":"사무실","audio":"/audio/e94254252a6c513183a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61202","senseId":"1","lemma":"사무실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사무실","audio":"/audio/e94254252a6c513183a9.mp3"}},{"text":"전체가","meaning":"全体","explanation":"전체：全体；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"전체","audio":"/audio/a4b69faf0c1113faf1f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62391","senseId":"1","lemma":"전체","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전체가","audio":"/audio/d6587cef03719929e43c.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"탔으니","meaning":"烧，燃，燃烧，着火","explanation":"타다：烧，燃，燃烧，着火；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91122","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"탔으니","audio":"/audio/944d75de504b30584a7d.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"다행이다.","meaning":"万幸，幸事，走运","explanation":"다행：万幸，幸事，走运；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"다행","audio":"/audio/c1308a8fe6495062fda3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28359","senseId":"1","lemma":"다행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다행이다","audio":"/audio/f2e88d62823b0444f894.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"82bd547e58bb6509","term":"그래도","zh":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3","entryId":"36264","definition":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"e94254252a6c5131","term":"사무실","zh":"办公室","audio":"/audio/e94254252a6c513183a9.mp3","entryId":"61202","definition":"职场中主要用于各自处理文件等业务的房间。","pronunciation":["사ː무실"]},{"id":"a4b69faf0c1113fa","term":"전체","zh":"全体","audio":"/audio/a4b69faf0c1113faf1f7.mp3","entryId":"62391","definition":"把由一个个或部分的集合组成的东西作为一个对象时所指的该对象。","pronunciation":["전체"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"烧，燃，燃烧，着火","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"91122","definition":"因火苗或高温而燃气火焰或火势蔓延。","pronunciation":["타다"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"c1308a8fe6495062","term":"다행","zh":"万幸，幸事，走运","audio":"/audio/c1308a8fe6495062fda3.mp3","entryId":"28359","definition":"意外地运气好。","pronunciation":["다행"]}],"audio":"/audio/85063bc15eb3717d0440.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.867,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62599","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":57,"sequenceScore":2.5923,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["